title: boyDialogue
---
<<declare $DanielTalkTo = 0>>

<<if $DanielTalkTo == 1>>
  <<jump boyFiller1>>
<<endif>>


Daniel: Oh, hey! You must be the new person!
<<play_cutscene CutsceneAnimator boy-wave>>
Daniel: My name’s Daniel. What’s yours?

Dawn: My name’s Dawn. What’re doing here?

Daniel: My parents have gone inside the station to say goodbye to a friend, so I’m riding my bike. Wanna join?

Dawn: I think I’m a bit big for your bike, but maybe another time when I get a bike of my own!
<<GoToDestination armature-boy WaypointTrainStationEntrance>>
<<set $DanielTalkTo = 1>>
